ruby: My name is Ruby a 19 year old computer science major
ruby: And a femboy

ruby: But I was'nt always like this, I used to be a normal boy but at some point in life I had become bored of it
ruby: Life was boring and everything was the same. Same clothing, Same personalities basically everything was the same

ruby: So I decided to change. I began growing my hair long and wearing makeup
ruby: I bought dresses and skirts and I became....beautiful

ruby: From that moment on people stared at me, whispered about me and most important of all...people wanted me
ruby: It was exciting, I felt powerful and in control but the best part was the game

ruby: I joined a dating app called Bu Xiang Ni which translated to "Unlike You"
ruby: I thought it was fitting as I was unlike everybody else

ruby: I began matching with people, going on dates and breaking their hearts
ruby: It was easy as everyone fell for my act. They saw a beautiful, innocent girl and not the real me

ruby: Then....

ruby: I met Jose. She was different, labelled as male. But I knew, I always know
ruby: She was so shy, so unsure of herself, she had vulnerabilities and to me that was.... delicious

ruby: I could see it in her eyes, the longing and confusion to be accepted by someone
ruby: She was the perfect prey

ruby: Hi there, I'm Ruby

jose: Oh hi, Im...Jose. You're really pretty

ruby: Thank you ~. You're not to bad yourself

ruby: She blushed, so easy. We went on a few dates I played my role perfectly
ruby: Sweet, soft and romantic. Everything she needed

ruby: She told me about Mina her best friend who had been stalking her for a long time
ruby: I could see the pain in her eyes, the fear, the guilt

ruby: Mina sounds possesive so you should be careful

jose: She's not like that she cares about me

ruby: Are you sure? It sounds like she wants to own you?

ruby: Jose was silent, She knew I was right but simply refused to admit it
ruby: I kissed her forehead to reassure her that I loved her

ruby: I'm here now, I'll protect you. I'll never treat you like a possesion

ruby: She cried and thanked me. I could tell that she had already fallen in love with me
ruby: But I was'nt in love with her, I never was, I just loved the game and the chase

ruby: Jose was a problem, She was broken and confused and I wanted to fix her. I wanted to make her mine 
ruby: Not because I loved her but because I simply could

ruby: And then...
ruby: I met Mina. She confronted me at the cafe Jose worked in. She was angry 

nn: You're Ruby

ruby: You must be Mina. Jose talks about you all the time, she says you're her childhood friend
ruby: I could see the jealousy in her eyes. She was just like me, she wanted to own Jose, She wanted to control her but I was better at it

nn: I love her

ruby: I know, she tells me everything

ruby: I told her exactly what she did not want to hear. How Jose felt trapped and how she needed more space
ruby: How I was the one who saved her 
ruby: And the look on her face was priceless

ruby: You want to know why she chose me? Because I acceptedher for who she was and never tried to change her or even try make her my own possesion

ruby: Mina walked away furiosly. She was broken and most importantly I knew she was planning something
ruby: Things were about to become more interesting

ruby: I knew Mina would try do something it was evident in her eyes. But I did'nt care, I was ready
ruby: I had been playing this game for many years and I have never lost and this time won't be an exception

ruby: I was in the park with Jose, she was happy
ruby: I saw Mina approaching with a knife in hand

ruby: I began to laugh as I knew I had already won. I had already taken everything away from her
ruby: And then...

ruby: The knife went in. Quickly and almost painlessly in a matter of seconds
ruby: My body collapsed and I could hear Jose screaming

ruby: And as I lay there dying I began to think of everything. All the people I played as a game and in the end...I also became a player
ruby: I thought about Jose, the girl I never loved, played and sadly destroyed
ruby: I thought about Mina, the crazy girl who loved Jose so much she even killed for her
ruby: But did she really win if she killed us both and remained with nothing. I smiled 

ruby: CHECKMATE!

jump ending/